@host = http://localhost:5080

### API catalog
GET {{host}}/api

### Home dashboard KPIs
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/summary

### Customers grid: search, sort, filter, page
GET {{host}}/api/customers?search=market&sort=-totalSales&filter=country:in:USA|Canada&page=1&pageSize=25

### Customer dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/customers/1/dashboard

### Create customer (code is generated when omitted)
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Contoso Fine Foods",
  "contactName": "Ana Trujillo",
  "contactTitle": "Owner",
  "city": "Seattle",
  "country": "USA"
}

### Overdue orders
GET {{host}}/api/orders?filter=status:eq:Overdue&sort=requiredDate

### Create order with lines (stock is allocated)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "employeeId": 1,
  "shipViaId": 2,
  "freight": 18.5,
  "details": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 10, "discount": 0.05 },
    { "productId": 43, "quantity": 4 }
  ]
}

### Ship an order (pick a pending one: GET /api/orders?filter=status:eq:Pending)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/15149/ship
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Order dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/orders/10248/dashboard

### Reports
GET {{host}}/api/reports/quarterly-orders?sort=-total&pageSize=10
###
GET {{host}}/api/reports/sales-by-category
###
GET {{host}}/api/reports/sales-by-year

### Gantt for a project (task ids are global, not per project: read them from here)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/gantt

### Insert a task below task 43
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Review with stakeholders",
  "afterTaskId": 43,
  "durationDays": 2,
  "assignments": [ { "resourceId": 1, "units": 100 } ]
}

### Ribbon: indent / outdent / move / % complete
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/44/indent
###
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/44/outdent
###
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/44/move
Content-Type: application/json

{ "direction": "up" }
###
PATCH {{host}}/api/tasks/44/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{ "percentComplete": 50 }

### Font formatting
PUT {{host}}/api/tasks/44/format
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isBold": true, "foregroundColor": "#C62828" }

### Add a dependency (start-to-start, 1 day lag)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/dependencies
Content-Type: application/json

{ "predecessorId": 42, "successorId": 47, "type": "StartToStart", "lagDays": 1 }

### Resource workload
GET {{host}}/api/resources/1/workload

### Marketing dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/marketing/dashboard

### Leads in the pipeline
GET {{host}}/api/leads?filter=status:in:Qualified|Proposal&sort=-estimatedValue

### Convert a lead to a customer
POST {{host}}/api/leads/1/convert

### Log a lead activity
POST {{host}}/api/leads/1/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "Call", "subject": "Discovery call", "notes": "Interested in seafood range." }

### Global search
GET {{host}}/api/search?q=chai

### Avatar image
GET {{host}}/api/avatars/customers/1.svg

### Regenerate the database
POST {{host}}/api/admin/reset-database
